== Quests ==
'''Note:''' For the older versions of the rewards for these quests (prior to the 7/24/11 patch) see [[Plane of Sky Quests (Old)]].

Talk to Medicine Man Veetra in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'hail Medicine Man Veetra'
:''Medicine Man Veetra says 'Good day to you. Are you a shaman of [much experience]? ''
You say, 'Yes I am a shaman of much experience'
:''Medicine Man Veetra says 'Then welcome to the tests of the medicine man. I have two tomes, each tells of a shaman of great accomplishment. They are Gina MacStargan and Ooga. Simply tell me the name of the shaman you want to be tested by. ''

= Gina MacStargan =

You say, 'I wish to be tested by Gina MacStargan'
:''Medicine Man Veetra says 'Return this tome to me if you wish me to call forth Gina. Destroy it if you do not. ''
:''Gina MacStargan says 'Hail, I have come to assist. ''
:''Medicine Man Veetra says 'I am no longer needed and will take my leave. ''
You say, 'hail Gina MacStargan'
:''Gina MacStargan says 'Hello, Xekl . I am the keeper of the tests of might, of health, and of sight.  I also have been intrusted allow players to trade back their old items for a upgraded version. ''
You say, 'I wish to trade'
:''Gina MacStargan says 'I am currently looking for the following.  Drake Fang Amulet, Elder Shaman's Ceremonial Bracelet, or a Sphinx-Hide Mantle.  I will reward you fairly for your work if you bring me for any one of those items. ''

== Shaman Test of Might ==

Gina MacStargan says 'The test of might it is. Go find an auburn tessera, a drake fang and a leather cord. Bring them to me when you have them all and I shall reward you. 

'''Reward:''' {{:Amulet of the Fang}}

